+- `entry-drop`: **PENDING_FINAL_LOG**.
+
+Logs: `05-kprove-entry-empty.log`, `05-kprove-entry-keep.log`, and
+`05-kprove-entry-drop.log`.
+
+## Static inventory and adequacy checks
+
+From `/audit-output`:
