index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..f13711b2e3ce19cd790c782bf823e76f93e6b251
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/COMMANDS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,162 @@
+# Reviewer command ledger
+
+Unless a block says otherwise, commands ran from
+`/tmp/audit-work/26-remove-duplicates/candidate`. Full bounded output is in the
+named log.
+
+## Integrity and provenance
+
+From `/audit-output`:
+
+```bash
