+```bash
+kprove spec.k \
+  --definition verification-kompiled \
+  --spec-module REMOVE-DUPLICATES-SPEC \
+  --claims REMOVE-DUPLICATES-SPEC.CLAIM \
+  --trusted REMOVE-DUPLICATES-SPEC.loop-invariant \
+  --output pretty
